    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points Transfer API enables the updating and management of loyalty points across hotel programs. This endpoint allows businesses to adjust loyalty point balances for customers based on specific transfer criteria. Typical use cases include reconciling points after customer service inquiries or modifying accounts to align with special promotions. Organizations in the hospitality sector, loyalty program providers, and customer support teams are primary consumers of this functionality.",
